{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnTrace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnTrace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnRMatrix","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.MarkovClosure"],"declarations":47,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markovFamily_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markovFamily_sigma","kind":"theorem","line":430,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L430-L433","doc":"The trace of the single crossing `σ_0 ∈ H_2` is the Markov parameter `q^n/[n]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markov_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markov_eq","kind":"theorem","line":423,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L423-L428","doc":"**The closure is THE Markov trace with parameter `q^n/[n]_q`.**  It agrees with every Markov\ntrace family on the Hecke tower with that parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markovFamily_tr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markovFamily_tr","kind":"theorem","line":416,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L416-L421","doc":"The value of the closure trace: `tr_m (x) = d^{-(m+1)} · (closure of ρ_m(x))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markovFamily","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.markovFamily","kind":"def","line":409,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L409-L414","doc":"**The normalised closure of the `GL_n` model is a Markov trace** on the Hecke tower, with\nMarkov parameter `z = q^n / [n]_q` (here `dinv` is an inverse of `[n]_q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.unitScalar_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.unitScalar_id","kind":"theorem","line":407,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L407-L407","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.unitScalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.unitScalar","kind":"def","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L401-L405","doc":"The scalar of an endomorphism of the unit object `R` of `ModuleCat R`: `f ↦ f 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.loop_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.loop_mul","kind":"theorem","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L388-L398","doc":"**The loop value is the quantum integer.**  `(q - qi) · d = q^n - qi^n`, i.e. `d = [n]_q`;\nin Brundan's variables (`t = q^n`, `z = q - qi`) this is `z δ = t - t⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftTrace_w","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftTrace_w","kind":"theorem","line":386,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L386-L386","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftTrace_d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftTrace_d","kind":"theorem","line":383,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L383-L384","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftTrace","kind":"def","line":371,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L371-L381","doc":"**The quantum partial trace of the `GL_n` model is a left trace**, with loop value\n`d = ∑_i q^{n-1-i} qi^i` and curl value `q^n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr2_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr2_conj","kind":"theorem","line":356,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L356-L367","doc":"**Markov's first move on the two closed strands.**  The double weighted closure of `Ř ≫ f`\nequals that of `f ≫ Ř`, for any weights. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef_weight","kind":"theorem","line":346,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L346-L354","doc":"**Weight conservation.**  For any weights, `w_a w_b = w_c w_d` wherever `e_c ⊗ e_d` occurs in\n`Ř (e_a ⊗ e_b)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":335,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L335-L344","doc":"`Ř` only permutes the two tensor indices: `Ř (e_a ⊗ e_b)` has no component outside\n`{e_a ⊗ e_b, e_b ⊗ e_a}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.repr_ee","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.repr_ee","kind":"theorem","line":332,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L332-L333","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.cross_rem2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.cross_rem2","kind":"theorem","line":320,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L320-L330","doc":"Moving the crossing into the removed pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem2_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem2_apply","kind":"theorem","line":307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L307-L318","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins2_cross","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins2_cross","kind":"theorem","line":298,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L298-L305","doc":"Moving the crossing into the inserted pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftCross_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.leftCross_apply","kind":"theorem","line":282,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L282-L296","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins2_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins2_apply","kind":"theorem","line":277,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L277-L279","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rv_eq_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rv_eq_sum","kind":"theorem","line":270,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L270-L275","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.coef","kind":"def","line":267,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L267-L268","doc":"The coefficient of `e_c ⊗ e_d` in `Ř (e_a ⊗ e_b)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_ptr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_ptr","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L260-L265","doc":"The double closure as a single sum over pairs of basis indices. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem2","kind":"def","line":256,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L256-L258","doc":"Remove `e_a ⊗ e_b` on the left: `x₁ ⊗ (x₂ ⊗ y) ↦ x₁_a x₂_b · y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins2","kind":"def","line":252,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L252-L254","doc":"Insert `e_a ⊗ e_b` on the left: `y ↦ e_a ⊗ (e_b ⊗ y)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.hom_ext_left2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.hom_ext_left2","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L235-L250","doc":"Morphisms out of `X ⊗ (X ⊗ Y)` agree if they agree on `e_a ⊗ (e_b ⊗ y)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_cross","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_cross","kind":"theorem","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L224-L231","doc":"**The curl.**  Closing the left strand of the crossing gives `q^n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.curl_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.curl_sum","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L205-L222","doc":"**The curl sum.**  `∑_i w_i · ⟨e_i ⊗ e_j | Ř | e_i ⊗ e_j⟩ = q^n` for every `j`: the weights\nare exactly those that make the closed curl a scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.curl_nat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.curl_nat","kind":"theorem","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L190-L203","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.wt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.wt","kind":"def","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L187-L188","doc":"The quantum weights `w_i = q^{n-1-i} qi^i` on the basis vectors of `X = R^n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.W","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.W","kind":"def","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L183-L184","doc":"The ℕ-indexed weights `W_m = q^{n-1-m} qi^m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_leftCross_rem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_leftCross_rem","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L157-L180","doc":"Closing the left strand of `Ř` against `e_i`, on `e_j ⊗ y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.diagCoef","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.diagCoef","kind":"def","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L154-L155","doc":"The diagonal coefficient of `Ř`: the `e_i ⊗ e_j` component of `Ř (e_i ⊗ e_j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.S_whiskerRight_apply'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.S_whiskerRight_apply'","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L151-L152","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_id","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L144-L145","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_comp_whisker","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_comp_whisker","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L140-L142","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_whisker_comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_whisker_comp","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L136-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr_apply","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L133-L134","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ptr","kind":"def","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L123-L131","doc":"The weighted partial trace over the leftmost factor, `f ↦ ∑_i w_i · (ι_i ≫ f ≫ π_i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.whisker_rem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.whisker_rem","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L114-L119","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_whisker","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_whisker","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L109-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_rem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_rem","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L105-L107","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.hom_ext_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.hom_ext_left","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L94-L103","doc":"Morphisms out of `X ⊗ Z` agree if they agree on `e_a ⊗ z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.e_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.e_apply","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L91-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem_apply","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L87-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins_apply","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L84-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.rem","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L79-L82","doc":"`π_i : X ⊗ Y ⟶ Y`, `x ⊗ y ↦ x_i · y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.ins","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnTrace.lean#L75-L77","doc":"`ι_i : Y ⟶ X ⊗ Y`, `y ↦ e_i ⊗ y`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}